# Backend code cache

Before scanning, read `docs/cache/README.md`, then only:

- `docs/cache/api.md` — Laravel API
- `docs/cache/dashboard.md` — staff SPA
- `docs/cache/bots.md` — Telegram bots

Open source files only for the change. After a milestone, update the matching file.
